476
00:41:06.010 --> 00:41:07.420
Hindi ba't iyon ang pangarap?

477
00:41:10.890 --> 00:41:12.989
Kaya mag-aral ng mabuti at magkolehiyo...

478
00:41:12.990 --> 00:41:14.640
Pangarap ko ba ngayon.

479
00:41:24.270 --> 00:41:26.610
Sige, mga miyembro ng Study Group.

480
00:41:28.310 --> 00:41:29.130
Sa wakas...

481
00:41:34.040 --> 00:41:37.080
Ang iskedyul ng finals ay sa wakas ay lumabas.

482
00:41:38.740 --> 00:41:40.380
Seryoso.

483
00:41:41.490 --> 00:41:42.729
Damn it.

484
00:41:42.730 --> 00:41:43.750
Gaano katagal tayo kukuha ng pagsusulit?

485
00:41:44.200 --> 00:41:45.759
Talagang matatalo ko si Lee Joon this time.

486
00:41:45.760 --> 00:41:46.889
Hindi ka mananalo.

487
00:41:46.890 --> 00:41:47.490
mananalo ako.

488
00:41:47.490 --> 00:41:48.090
Hindi ka mananalo.

489
00:41:48.090 --> 00:41:48.810
mananalo ako.

